{
  "id": "wonderland_poker_stand_guide",
  "title": "Wonderland Poker Stand",
  "item": "omnira:wonderland_poker_stand",
  "text": [
    "The stand gives off light and keeps its chunk loaded. Suits cycle in the order shown and affect players in that chunk.",
    "Suits normally change every five minutes. Fleeting Woods doubles the pace; Stilled Wastes stops it; Recurrence Garden advances it at biome nodes. During a mire reversal, the previous suit briefly returns while the normal timer continues.",
    "Sneak-right-click with an empty main hand to reveal the enclosing chunk’s corner edges and walls. The display expands outward at 3 blocks per second, holds at the chunk boundary for 5 seconds, then fades. It is only a marker and does not block movement. The walls and corner edges fade gradually toward the top."
  ],
